  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2b1ff878-aa4e-5305-883d-33dc60c1f40a" activityNameId="6c29791d-3a9c-5e23-aa03-eea1f6475f3e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, through-hole mounted, unspec., Pb free, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, through-hole mounted, unspec., Pb free, at plant
The data represent an unspecified, through-hole mounted, PWB , used in electronic and electric devices. Material data are based on literature and own dismantling activities. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. An update was made in 2023, comprising: modification to energy consumption and regionalization of inventory flows, such as energy and metal input (Duque Ciceri et al., 2010; Kupka et al., 2018.); Geography: Data represent a global valuable example for a unspecified, through-hole mounted, PWB.; UUID: a91a03ce-cfd8-3991-8487-ae472e951689
This dataset covers component input and production efforts (incl. PWB waste due to failure in mounting) for the production of an unspecified, through-hole mounted, PWB, using Pb-free solder material.
Location: Data represent a global valuable example for a unspecified, through-hole mounted, PWB.
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (wave soldering)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a91a03ce-cfd8-3991-8487-ae472e951689.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
